{"id":"n69191-1-7","stage":5,"title":"요건 · 重要事情","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69191-1-7-1","ko":"말씀 드릴 것이 있습니다.","zh":"我有话想跟您说。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"말씀","meaning":"话","explanation":"말씀：话。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}},{"text":"드릴","meaning":"致，道","explanation":"드리다：致，道；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61168","senseId":"2","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드릴","audio":"/audio/439eeb808dc5c805626c.mp3"}},{"text":"것이","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것이","audio":"/audio/466d343bd03b56aac534.mp3"}},{"text":"있습니다.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있습니다","audio":"/audio/de7385b84e32dd836700.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(敬语)别人的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]},{"id":"e583f55bf1cfad46","term":"드리다","zh":"致，道","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3","entryId":"61168","definition":"向上级或年长者说话或打招呼。","pronunciation":["드리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"96